{
  "item": "DeathBeamKnight01",
  "mu_name": "Death Beam Knight",
  "mu_name_from": "MuMain _enum.h MONSTER_DEATH_BEAM_KNIGHT (63), drawn out of the Beam Knight's model (MONSTER_MODEL_BEAM_KNIGHT, Monster45.bmd). OpenMU Version095d Maps/Tarkan.cs:456 names breed 63 'Death Beam Knight'; WebZen files it under bosses (Monster.txt:74). One spot, 161,225. docs/tarkan-port.md.",
  "world": "tarkan",
  "object_type": 63,
  "monster": {
    "model_index": 44,
    "scale": 1.9
  },
  "monster_from": "ZzzCharacter.cpp:13712-13729, case MONSTER_DEATH_BEAM_KNIGHT: Scale = 1.9f; BlendMesh = -2; BlendMeshLight = 1.f. Not drawn yet: its burning body (flame particles along the bones, MoveCharacterVisual :5843-5950), its Inferno and boss blow (Blasts within 400 units and a ring of 18 Staff of Destruction, :1810-1835), the eye trails and the sand smoke.",
  "mesh_from": "Its own build of Monster45, not a pointer at BeamKnight01's: DeathBeamKnight01.obj and .rig.json are the same export, because every mesh here is a glow and a glow is baked into the body's glb.",
  "profile": "monster",
  "rig_from": "BeamKnight01's: --actions=all, 7 actions, 88 bones, BoneHead 6, the 0.3 death.",
  "sheets": {
    "devil": "beamknight_devil.png",
    "devilhair": "beamknight_devilhair.png",
    "devilwing": "beamknight_devilwing.png"
  },
  "sheet_from": "The Beam Knight's three sheets: MU paints no second skin for it.",
  "sheet_materials": {
    "devil": "skin",
    "devilhair": "hair",
    "devilwing": "leather"
  },
  "sheet_materials_from": "As the Beam Knight's; every mesh is a glow, so these only name it.",
  "glow": {
    "devil": {
      "shadow": 0.5
    },
    "devilhair": {},
    "devilwing": {
      "shadow": 0.5
    }
  },
  "glow_from": "BlendMesh -2: RenderMesh adds every mesh whose index is not above it -- `blendMeshIndex <= -2 || m->Texture == blendMeshIndex` (ZzzBMD.cpp:1509-1516) -- so the whole knight is drawn added at BlendMeshLight 1, a dark ghost of the Beam Knight. Ours as the Valkyrie's: a glow that still casts half a shadow.",
  "sounds_from": "The Beam Knight model's: SetMonsterSound(..., 154, 154, 155, 155, 156), ZzzOpenData.cpp:3704-3709. Wired as deathbeamknight_* in sounds.json, as beamknight_*.",
